    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "C6F9AC8C0A673AC3",
      "text": "哎呀呀～那大概\\n不是虫宝可梦～！\\c\\n它还“电电”地叫了～！\\n或许它是“电电虫”～？[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
