    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "coach_gym_mushi_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "F7614DF83219026E",
      "text": "你的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]食欲旺盛，\\n总是会饿扁肚子～！\\c\\n它也会吃很多\\n我做的甜点～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
